# Wagon Train on a land trade route across three turns. Base: turns_spring_1600_events' output (France, Spring 1600, turn 108).
# Fixture: trade routes copied from map_trade_route_assign's output (route 0 "Land Haul": Guadeloupe load Lumber+Furs,
# Quebec unload Lumber+Ore / load Cotton, Montreal unload Cotton; route 1 "Sea Ferry"); Wagon Train #77 in Guadeloupe
# empty, orders TRADE_ROUTE (2), route 0 stop 0 (profession byte 0x00 = stop<<4 | route), goto = Guadeloupe, moves spent;
# Guadeloupe Lumber 100 (warehouse cap); every other French map unit fortified (orders 6), Caravel #148 (bound for
# Europe) parked in Quebec, France and England at peace (euro_relation 0x60 both ways, else English raids capture units).
# The wagon runs on its own each turn; a stop it reaches on its last MP is serviced next turn, after production
# (FUN_479b_0972 keeps order 2 without service, #1469): Guadeloupe loads 100 Lumber -> Quebec unloads it, loads 12 Cotton
# -> Montreal unloads the Cotton -> the test ends with the wagon back in Guadeloupe at stop 0, not yet serviced.
# The Dutch Europe buy pass gates on price * DS:0x8dc4 (last hold removal anywhere, TB-25): it now sees the wagon's
# 100-Lumber unload instead of its 12-Cotton one, so the Dutch (gold 64) no longer buy 100 Horses.
key space                  # end turn 108 (every unit has orders)
wait 120
key Return                 # Colonization Help: Time Scale
wait 24
key Return                 # Sons of Liberty in Quebec up to 60%
wait 24
key Return                 # price of Cigars rises to 11 (the wagon then runs Guadeloupe -> Quebec)
wait 24
key space                  # end turn 109
wait 120
key Return                 # Iroquois gift (16 Ore) at Port au Prince
wait 24
key Return                 # King raises the tax by 1% (Kiss pinky ring, row 0)
wait 24
key Return                 # Sons of Liberty in Port au Prince up to 12%
wait 24
key Return                 # Sons of Liberty in Martinique up to 51%
wait 24
key Return                 # Sons of Liberty in Guadeloupe up to 70%
wait 24
key Return                 # new cargo of Horses at Montreal (storage full)
wait 24
key space                  # end turn 110
wait 120
key Return                 # Tupi gift (11 Furs) at Quebec
wait 24
key Return                 # price of Cigars falls to 11
wait 24
key Return                 # price of Coats rises to 11; the wagon is back in Guadeloupe (stop 0, serviced next turn)
wait 24
